# =============================================================
# Cross-repo security hardening baseline (MarketI + NurIA-Odonto + Giproy Network, 2026-07)
# =============================================================

# Certificados y keys privadas (CRÍTICO)
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cert
secrets/
.secrets/
*.gpg
*.asc
gh-token
.token
*.kubeconfig

